<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#f6f7f2">
  <meta name="description" content="Découvrez la biotechnologie : parcours d’études, métiers, compétences et secteurs pour construire votre avenir dans les sciences du vivant.">
  <title>Bioavenir — La biotechnologie, en clair</title>
  <style>
    :root {
      color-scheme: light;
      --ink: #172f2c;
      --muted: #687671;
      --green: #245c4b;
      --green-dark: #193f36;
      --lime: #d7ed9f;
      --paper: #f6f7f2;
      --white: #fff;
      --line: #e5e9e1;
      --lavender: #eeebf7;
      --peach: #f8ece0;
      --shadow: 0 18px 50px rgba(27, 55, 46, .08);
      font-family: Inter, ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", sans-serif;
      font-synthesis: none;
      text-rendering: optimizeLegibility;
    }

    *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; }
    html { scroll-behavior: smooth; scroll-padding-top: 88px; }
    body { margin: 0; color: var(--ink); background: var(--paper); line-height: 1.6; }
    a { color: inherit; }
    button, input { font: inherit; }
    button:focus-visible, a:focus-visible, input:focus-visible {
      outline: 3px solid #8aaf56;
      outline-offset: 4px;
    }

    .shell { width: min(1120px, calc(100% - 48px)); margin-inline: auto; }
    .site-header {
      position: sticky;
      top: 0;
      z-index: 5;
      background: rgba(246, 247, 242, .93);
      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(229, 233, 225, .8);
      backdrop-filter: blur(14px);
    }
    .header-inner { min-height: 76px; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 24px; }
    .brand { display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -.05em; }
    .brand-mark {
      width: 35px; height: 35px; display: grid; place-items: center; color: var(--green-dark);
      background: var(--lime); border-radius: 12px; font-size: 19px;
    }
    .brand-name { font-size: 19px; }
    .brand-name span { color: var(--green); }
    .main-nav { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 27px; }
    .main-nav a { color: #53635e; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 650; text-decoration: none; }
    .main-nav a:hover { color: var(--green); }
    .nav-cta { padding: 10px 16px; color: white !important; background: var(--green-dark); border-radius: 999px; }

    .hero { padding: 76px 0 68px; overflow: hidden; }
    .hero-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1.05fr .95fr; align-items: center; gap: 48px; }
    .eyebrow {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; margin: 0 0 18px; color: var(--green);
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .13em; text-transform: uppercase;
    }
    .eyebrow::before { width: 8px; height: 8px; background: #95b95e; border-radius: 50%; content: ""; }
    h1, h2, h3, p { margin-top: 0; }
    h1 { max-width: 620px; margin-bottom: 19px; font-size: clamp(42px, 6vw, 68px); line-height: 1.04; letter-spacing: -.065em; }
    h1 em { color: var(--green); font-style: normal; }
    .hero-copy { max-width: 510px; margin-bottom: 27px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 16px; }
    .button-row { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
    .button {
      display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 9px; min-height: 46px;
      padding: 0 18px; border: 1px solid transparent; border-radius: 999px; font-size: 13px;
      font-weight: 750; text-decoration: none; transition: transform .18s ease, background .18s ease;
    }
    .button:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); }
    .button-primary { color: white; background: var(--green-dark); }
    .button-primary:hover { background: var(--green); }
    .button-secondary { border-color: #dce3d9; background: transparent; }
    .button-secondary:hover { background: white; }
    .hero-note { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 9px; margin: 23px 0 0; color: #78837e; font-size: 11px; }
    .hero-note strong { color: var(--green); }

    .visual {
      position: relative; min-height: 380px; display: grid; place-items: center;
      border: 1px solid #e8ebdf; border-radius: 34px; overflow: hidden;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse at 50% 45%, #e8f0d7 0, #e8f0d7 19%, transparent 20%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 15% 16%, #f9f0e2 0, #f9f0e2 23%, transparent 24%),
        radial-gradient(ellipse at 88% 90%, #e9e5f4 0, #e9e5f4 24%, transparent 25%), #f0f3e8;
    }
    .visual::before, .visual::after {
      position: absolute; width: 250px; height: 250px; border: 1px solid rgba(49, 93, 73, .13);
      border-radius: 50%; content: "";
    }
    .visual::after { width: 320px; height: 320px; }
    .dna { position: relative; z-index: 1; width: 210px; height: 280px; overflow: visible; }
    .float-card {
      position: absolute; z-index: 2; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; padding: 12px 15px;
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,.9); border-radius: 15px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.9);
      box-shadow: 0 12px 30px rgba(42, 66, 52, .1); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 750;
    }
    .float-card span:first-child { width: 31px; height: 31px; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 10px; background: var(--lime); font-size: 15px; }
    .float-one { top: 52px; left: 21px; }
    .float-two { right: 15px; bottom: 56px; }
    .visual-label { position: absolute; bottom: 18px; left: 23px; color: #75837a; font-size: 10px; letter-spacing: .06em; text-transform: uppercase; }

    .quick-facts { padding: 21px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); border-bottom: 1px solid var(--line); background: rgba(255,255,255,.52); }
    .facts-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr); gap: 20px; }
    .fact { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; }
    .fact-icon { width: 38px; height: 38px; flex: 0 0 auto; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 12px; background: white; font-size: 17px; }
    .fact strong, .fact span { display: block; }
    .fact strong { font-size: 13px; }
    .fact span { color: var(--muted); font-size: 10px; }

    .section { padding: 88px 0; }
    .section-heading { max-width: 610px; margin-bottom: 34px; }
    .section-heading h2 { margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: clamp(30px, 4vw, 43px); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -.05em; }
    .section-heading > p:last-child { margin-bottom: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; }
    .two-column { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .8fr 1.2fr; gap: 58px; align-items: start; }
    .intro-card { padding: 26px; border-radius: 22px; background: var(--green-dark); color: white; }
    .intro-card .mini-label { margin-bottom: 16px; color: var(--lime); font-size: 10px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .12em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .intro-card h3 { margin-bottom: 12px; font-size: 22px; line-height: 1.2; letter-spacing: -.035em; }
    .intro-card p { margin-bottom: 0; color: #d3ddd4; font-size: 12px; }
    .topic-list { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 14px; }
    .topic { padding: 19px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 16px; background: white; }
    .topic-icon { display: block; margin-bottom: 11px; font-size: 20px; }
    .topic h3 { margin-bottom: 5px; font-size: 13px; }
    .topic p { margin-bottom: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; }

    .study-section { background: #edf1e9; }
    .study-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: .75fr 1.25fr; gap: 56px; align-items: start; }
    .study-intro { position: sticky; top: 105px; }
    .study-intro .section-heading { margin-bottom: 20px; }
    .notice { padding: 15px 16px; border: 1px solid #dfe6d9; border-radius: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,.6); color: #53645a; font-size: 11px; }
    .notice strong { color: var(--green-dark); }
    .timeline { position: relative; display: grid; gap: 12px; }
    .timeline::before { position: absolute; top: 24px; bottom: 24px; left: 20px; width: 1px; background: #d7dfd2; content: ""; }
    .study-card { position: relative; display: grid; grid-template-columns: 42px 1fr; gap: 13px; padding: 17px; border: 1px solid #e4e9e0; border-radius: 17px; background: white; }
    .study-step { z-index: 1; width: 40px; height: 40px; display: grid; place-items: center; border: 1px solid #dce8ca; border-radius: 13px; background: #f2f7e9; color: var(--green); font-size: 11px; font-weight: 800; }
    .study-card h3 { margin: 2px 0 5px; font-size: 14px; }
    .study-card p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 11px; }
    .study-card .duration { display: inline-block; margin-bottom: 4px; color: #78904f; font-size: 9px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: .08em; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .alternatives { margin-top: 16px; padding: 17px 19px; border-radius: 16px; background: #e3e9dd; }
    .alternatives strong { display: block; margin-bottom: 4px; font-size: 12px; }
    .alternatives p { margin: 0; color: #5f6e63; font-size: 11px; }

    .careers-section { background: white; }
    .career-toolbar { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 16px; margin: -5px 0 22px; }
    .filters { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 7px; }
    .filter-button { padding: 8px 13px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px; background: white; color: #65736d; cursor: pointer; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 700; }
    .filter-button[aria-pressed="true"] { border-color: var(--green-dark); background: var(--green-dark); color: white; }
    .search-wrap { position: relative; }
    .search-wrap::before { position: absolute; top: 8px; left: 12px; color: #77847d; content: "⌕"; font-size: 17px; }
    .search-input { width: min(230px, 70vw); height: 37px; padding: 0 12px 0 34px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 999px; background: #fbfcfa; font-size: 11px; }
    .career-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 14px; }
    .career-card { min-height: 190px; padding: 19px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 17px; background: #fff; transition: transform .18s ease, box-shadow .18s ease; }
    .career-card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: var(--shadow); }
    .career-card[hidden] { display: none; }
    .career-top { display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 15px; }
    .career-icon { width: 37px; height: 37px; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 12px; background: #edf3e6; font-size: 17px; }
    .career-tag { padding: 5px 8px; border-radius: 999px; background: #f4f3ef; color: #68766d; font-size: 8px; font-weight: 750; text-transform: uppercase; }
    .career-card h3 { margin-bottom: 7px; font-size: 14px; }
    .career-card p { min-height: 38px; margin-bottom: 12px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 10px; }
    .career-level { padding-top: 10px; border-top: 1px solid #edf0eb; color: #596961; font-size: 9px; }
    .career-level strong { color: var(--green); }
    .empty-state { display: none; padding: 24px; border: 1px dashed #d4ddd1; border-radius: 15px; color: var(--muted); text-align: center; font-size: 13px; }
    .empty-state.visible { display: block; }

    .skills-layout { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 22px; }
    .skills-card { padding: 25px; border: 1px solid var(--line); border-radius: 19px; background: white; }
    .skills-card h3 { margin-bottom: 17px; font-size: 16px; }
    .skill-list { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; }
    .skill-chip { padding: 8px 11px; border-radius: 999px; background: #eef3e8; color: #43604c; font-size: 10px; font-weight: 650; }
    .skill-chip:nth-child(3n) { background: var(--lavender); color: #635b80; }
    .skill-chip:nth-child(3n + 2) { background: var(--peach); color: #88654a; }

    .outlook { padding: 0 0 88px; }
    .outlook-card { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; align-items: center; gap: 28px; padding: 38px; border-radius: 24px; background: var(--lime); }
    .outlook-card .eyebrow { margin-bottom: 11px; color: var(--green-dark); }
    .outlook-card h2 { max-width: 600px; margin-bottom: 9px; font-size: clamp(27px, 4vw, 38px); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -.05em; }
    .outlook-card p:last-child { max-width: 580px; margin: 0; color: #526647; font-size: 12px; }
    .outlook-arrow { width: 55px; height: 55px; display: grid; place-items: center; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--green-dark); color: white; font-size: 23px; text-decoration: none; transition: transform .18s ease; }
    .outlook-arrow:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); }
    footer { padding: 22px 0; border-top: 1px solid var(--line); color: #78837e; font-size: 10px; }
    .footer-inner { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: space-between; gap: 10px; }
    .footer-inner p { margin: 0; }
    .footer-inner a { color: var(--green); font-weight: 700; text-decoration: none; }

    @media (max-width: 800px) {
      .hero-grid, .two-column, .study-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero-grid { gap: 33px; }
      .visual { min-height: 330px; }
      .facts-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .study-intro { position: static; }
      .career-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .section { padding: 70px 0; }
      .outlook { padding-bottom: 70px; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 560px) {
      .shell { width: min(100% - 32px, 1120px); }
      .header-inner { min-height: 66px; align-items: flex-start; flex-direction: column; justify-content: center; gap: 8px; padding-block: 10px; }
      .main-nav { width: 100%; gap: 18px; overflow-x: auto; padding-bottom: 2px; }
      .main-nav a { flex: 0 0 auto; font-size: 11px; }
      .nav-cta { padding: 5px 10px; }
      .hero { padding: 53px 0 49px; }
      h1 { font-size: 46px; }
      .hero-copy { font-size: 14px; }
      .visual { min-height: 290px; border-radius: 25px; }
      .float-one { left: 10px; }
      .float-two { right: 8px; }
      .facts-grid { gap: 16px 10px; }
      .fact { gap: 8px; }
      .fact-icon { width: 33px; height: 33px; }
      .fact strong { font-size: 11px; }
      .fact span { font-size: 9px; }
      .topic-list, .career-grid, .skills-layout { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .career-card { min-height: auto; }
      .career-card p { min-height: 0; }
      .career-toolbar { align-items: flex-start; }
      .filters { gap: 6px; }
      .filter-button { padding: 7px 10px; }
      .search-wrap { width: 100%; }
      .search-input { width: 100%; }
      .outlook-card { grid-template-columns: 1fr auto; gap: 12px; padding: 25px 20px; }
      .outlook-arrow { width: 43px; height: 43px; }
    }
    @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
      *, *::before, *::after { scroll-behavior: auto !important; transition-duration: .01ms !important; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="shell header-inner">
      <a class="brand" href="#accueil" aria-label="Bioavenir, accueil">
        <span class="brand-mark" aria-hidden="true">⌬</span>
        <span class="brand-name">bio<span>avenir</span></span>
      </a>
      <nav class="main-nav" aria-label="Navigation principale">
        <a href="#decouvrir">Découvrir</a>
        <a href="#etudes">Les études</a>
        <a href="#metiers">Les métiers</a>
        <a href="#competences">Compétences</a>
        <a class="nav-cta" href="#etudes">Trouver ma voie <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main>
    <section class="hero" id="accueil">
      <div class="shell hero-grid">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">Le guide des sciences du vivant</p>
          <h1>La science du vivant. <em>Votre avenir.</em></h1>
          <p class="hero-copy">Santé, environnement, alimentation… La biotechnologie transforme les découvertes scientifiques en solutions utiles au quotidien. Explorez les études et les métiers qui font avancer le vivant.</p>
          <div class="button-row">
            <a class="button button-primary" href="#metiers">Explorer les métiers <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
            <a class="button button-secondary" href="#etudes">Comprendre les études</a>
          </div>
          <p class="hero-note"><strong>Un domaine, mille parcours.</strong> Sciences, technique, numérique ou gestion de projet.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="visual" aria-label="Illustration stylisée d’une molécule d’ADN">
          <svg class="dna" viewBox="0 0 210 280" role="img" aria-labelledby="dna-title">
            <title id="dna-title">Double hélice d’ADN stylisée</title>
            <path d="M58 16 C166 62 44 105 151 145 C258 185 44 221 151 264" fill="none" stroke="#245c4b" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <path d="M151 16 C44 62 166 105 58 145 C-49 185 166 221 58 264" fill="none" stroke="#91b65a" stroke-width="8" stroke-linecap="round"/>
            <g stroke="#c1d58f" stroke-width="4" stroke-linecap="round">
              <path d="M84 34 125 34"/><path d="M65 64 144 64"/><path d="M66 94 143 94"/>
              <path d="M82 124 126 124"/><path d="M83 164 126 164"/><path d="M66 194 143 194"/>
              <path d="M66 224 143 224"/><path d="M82 250 126 250"/>
            </g>
            <g fill="#f6f7f2" stroke="#245c4b" stroke-width="4">
              <circle cx="58" cy="16" r="8"/><circle cx="151" cy="16" r="8"/>
              <circle cx="151" cy="264" r="8"/><circle cx="58" cy="264" r="8"/>
            </g>
          </svg>
          <div class="float-card float-one"><span aria-hidden="true">🧬</span><span>Comprendre le vivant</span></div>
          <div class="float-card float-two"><span aria-hidden="true">🌱</span><span>Imaginer des solutions</span></div>
          <span class="visual-label">Sciences · innovation · impact</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="quick-facts" aria-label="La biotechnologie en bref">
      <div class="shell facts-grid">
        <div class="fact"><span class="fact-icon" aria-hidden="true">🔬</span><div><strong>Du labo au terrain</strong><span>Recherche, essais, production</span></div></div>
        <div class="fact"><span class="fact-icon" aria-hidden="true">🩺</span><div><strong>Des secteurs variés</strong><span>Santé, agro, environnement</span></div></div>
        <div class="fact"><span class="fact-icon" aria-hidden="true">🧪</span><div><strong>Plusieurs parcours</strong><span>Du bac pro au doctorat</span></div></div>
        <div class="fact"><span class="fact-icon" aria-hidden="true">🤝</span><div><strong>Des métiers d’équipe</strong><span>Sciences et savoir-faire croisés</span></div></div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section" id="decouvrir">
      <div class="shell two-column">
        <div>
          <p class="eyebrow">D’abord, le domaine</p>
          <div class="section-heading">
            <h2>La biotechnologie, c’est quoi exactement&nbsp;?</h2>
            <p>Elle utilise des organismes vivants, des cellules ou des molécules biologiques pour comprendre le vivant et développer de nouveaux produits ou procédés.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="intro-card">
            <p class="mini-label">Le saviez-vous&nbsp;?</p>
            <h3>Une découverte ne reste pas toujours au laboratoire.</h3>
            <p>Elle peut devenir un médicament, un test de diagnostic, une culture plus résistante ou un procédé de fabrication moins polluant. Chaque étape mobilise des compétences différentes.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="topic-list" aria-label="Principaux domaines de la biotechnologie">
          <article class="topic"><span class="topic-icon" aria-hidden="true">🩺</span><h3>Biotechnologies rouges</h3><p>Santé, vaccins, médicaments, thérapies et diagnostic médical.</p></article>
          <article class="topic"><span class="topic-icon" aria-hidden="true">🌾</span><h3>Biotechnologies vertes</h3><p>Agriculture, sélection végétale et amélioration des cultures.</p></article>
          <article class="topic"><span class="topic-icon" aria-hidden="true">♻️</span><h3>Biotechnologies blanches</h3><p>Industrie, fermentation et procédés de production plus sobres.</p></article>
          <article class="topic"><span class="topic-icon" aria-hidden="true">🌊</span><h3>Biotechnologies bleues</h3><p>Ressources marines, biodiversité et organismes aquatiques.</p></article>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <section class="section study-section" id="etudes">
      <div class="shell study-grid">
        <div class="study-intro">
          <p class="eyebrow">Construire son parcours</p>
          <div class="section-heading">
            <h2>Quelles études pour travailler en biotech&nbsp;?</h2>
            <p>Il n’existe pas une seule voie. Le diplôme dépend surtout du métier visé, du niveau de responsabilité et de la part de recherche souhaitée.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="notice"><strong>À retenir :</strong> en France, les admissions, intitulés et spécialisations varient selon les établissements. Vérifiez les programmes et prérequis sur leurs sites et sur Parcoursup.</div>
        </div>
        <div>
          <div class="timeline">
            <article class="study-card">
              <span class="study-step" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
              <div><span class="duration">Après la 3e · 2 à 3 ans</span><h3>Découvrir les sciences appliquées</h3><p>Bac général avec des spécialités scientifiques, ou voie technologique comme STL. Un bac professionnel peut aussi mener à certains postes techniques via une poursuite d’études adaptée.</p></div>
            </article>
            <article class="study-card">
              <span class="study-step" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
              <div><span class="duration">Bac +2 / bac +3</span><h3>Apprendre les gestes de laboratoire</h3><p>BTS biologie médicale, bioanalyses en laboratoire de contrôle ou biotechnologie en recherche et en production ; BUT génie biologique ; licence en sciences de la vie. Les intitulés évoluent : vérifiez l’offre actuelle.</p></div>
            </article>
            <article class="study-card">
              <span class="study-step" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
              <div><span class="duration">Bac +5</span><h3>Se spécialiser et piloter des projets</h3><p>Master en biotechnologies, biologie-santé, bio-informatique ou bioprocédés, ou diplôme d’ingénieur en biotechnologies, génie biologique ou génie des procédés.</p></div>
            </article>
            <article class="study-card">
              <span class="study-step" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
